<title>AUSTRALIA: No decision on Australia media ownership yet-govt.</title>
<headline>No decision on Australia media ownership yet-govt.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian acting Prime Minister Tim Fischer said on Tuesday that the government had not yet made a decision on any reform of the country's media ownership laws.</p>
<p>&quot;I share the desire and objective of maximising media diversity,&quot; Fischer told a Liberal party lunch.</p>
<p>&quot;These are matters before the government -- no final decision has been made.&quot;</p>
</text>
